 can  rattle off a list of the things that are  wrong with the way dinosaurs are  depicted jurassic world dominion still  makes some mistakes but it uses its  script and its new creature designs to  correct some long-standing errors in the  original dr grant tells a bratty kid who  doesn't think velociraptors are scary  that their six-inch retractable claws  would have been used to disembowel him  he slashes at you  here or here  his dialogue in jurassic world dominion  sets the record straight as he clarifies  paleontologists now think he would have  just gone for the neck this is closer to  the truth these small raptors would have  just used their small claws to pin down  prey but you can only retcon the lore of  a six film franchise so much the final  jurassic park film also fixes some  visual and audio problems theropods like  raptors t-rex and giganotosaurus are  mostly shown with their palms facing  inward instead of dangling downward as  they should have been and their  vocalizations sound more like a low bird  or reptile bellowing than lion roars  which is also an improvement  the point is  you are alive  when they start to eat you  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies and tv shows are  coming soon subscribe to our youtube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one  you

